<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{{title}}</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #eef0f6; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #131a31; }
      .container { max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; background: #f7f8fc; border: 1px solid #e5e8f3; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; padding: 20px; }
      .headline { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px; }
      .description { color: #3f4660; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; }
      .event-card { border: 1px solid #dce2f4; border-radius: 10px; background: #ffffff; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .event-image { width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
      .event-body { padding: 12px; }
      .event-name { margin: 0; color: #4c5fd8; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; }
      .code-box { margin: 16px 0; background: #eceff8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; text-align: center; }
      .code-label { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #54607d; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
      .code-value { margin: 0; font-family: monospace; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #283472; }
      .discount { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5577; }
      .cta { text-align: center; margin-top: 18px; }
      .cta a { display: inline-block; background: #596ef4; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
      .message { margin-top: 14px; padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e8f3; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5577; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <p class="headline">Tienes un código promocional para {{eventName}}</p>
      <p class="description">
        Hola {{recipientName}}, {{organizerName}} te ha compartido un código promocional para que adquieras tus entradas con descuento.
      </p>

      {{#if eventImage}}
      <div class="event-card">
        <img class="event-image" src="{{eventImage}}" alt="{{eventName}}" />
        <div class="event-body">
          <p class="event-name">{{eventName}}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {{/if}}

      <div class="code-box">
        <p class="code-label">Tu código promocional</p>
        <p class="code-value">{{promoCode}}</p>
        {{#if discountLabel}}
        <p class="discount">Descuento: {{discountLabel}}</p>
        {{/if}}
      </div>

      {{#if message}}
      <div class="message">{{message}}</div>
      {{/if}}

      <div class="cta">
        <a href="{{link}}">Ver evento y redimir código</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
